        "format": "<style>\n    @keyframes clignoteQualite {\n\n        0%,\n        100% {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        50% {\n            opacity: 0.2;\n        }\n    }\n\n    .lampe-qualite {\n        width: 22px;\n        height: 22px;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        background: #16a34a;\n        margin-right: 12px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .lampe-qualite.danger {\n        background: #ef4444;\n        animation: clignoteQualite 0.7s infinite;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px;\">\n    <span class=\"lampe-qualite\"\n        ng-class=\"{'danger': msg.payload === true}\">\n  </span>\n\n   <strong>\n    {{msg.payload === true\n    ? 'Attention : taux de défaut élevé'\n    : msg.payload === false\n      ? 'Aucune alerte qualité'\n      : 'En attente de données'}}\n   </strong>\n</div>",
